      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHEELSOFORTUNE (1) was edged out narrowly as a hot favourite last start but was brave when placed from this barrier in the Westbred 3CG Classic prior. He'll be race fit after placing in all three outings so far this campaign and won the only time he raced here. Gets his chance to break through. BETTOR BEHAVE (2) was the horse that narrowly got the better of WHEELSOFORTUNE in a last-start Wagin win. He draws lower than he did there so is a big chance to do it again. TEXAS STORM (3) raced parked when fourth to BETTOR BEHAVE from this barrier last start. Led from wider when he won at Gloucester Park prior. Go well. CEASE TO REACT (8) may need some luck from the back row but should be close to peak fitness third up.",
